      "ScriptKr": "#title;제6화;말 많고 시끄러운 녀석은 싫어",
      "TextJp": "第6話;熱血でうるさいバカが、嫌いなの",
      "TextCn": "第6话;我讨厌热血又吵闹的笨蛋",
      "TextTh": "ตอนที่ 6;ไม่ชอบเลยพวกหนวกหูเนี่ย",
      "TextTw": "第6話;我討厭熱血又吵鬧的笨蛋",
      "TextEn": "Episode 6; I Hate the Loud Ones",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "第6話 熱血でうるさいバカが、嫌いなの"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10014060,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;카즈사;02;……선생님? 무슨 일이야? 이렇게 늦은 밤에 사람을 다 불러내고.\n#3;a\n#3;em;[반응]",
      "TextJp": "……先生どうしたの？\nこんな時間に。",
      "TextCn": "……怎么了吗老师？\n这种时间找我出来。",
      "TextTh": "คุณครู...? มีเรื่องอะไรเหรอ? เรียกฉันออกมาดึกดื่นแบบนี้",
      "TextTw": "……怎麼了嗎老師？\n這種時間找我出來。",
      "TextEn": "Hello, Sensei. I figured it must be important if it couldn't wait until morning.",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0001.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[surprised]……先生どうしたの？\n[confused]こんな時間に。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10014060,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;카즈사;01;혹시 또 상담이라든가…….\n#3;stiff",
      "TextJp": "もしかしてまた相談とか……",
      "TextCn": "难道又是为了咨询吗……",
      "TextTh": "หรือว่าจะให้มาปรึกษาอะไรอีกเหรอ...",
      "TextTw": "難道又是為了諮詢嗎……",
      "TextEn": "Does this have to do with...the stuff you were helping me with?",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0002.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[hesitant]もしかしてまた相談とか……"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10014060,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;카즈사;01;……응?",
      "TextJp": "……え？",
      "TextCn": "……咦？",
      "TextTh": "หืม...?",
      "TextTw": "……咦？",
      "TextEn": "Huh?",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0003.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[surprised]……え？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10014060,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;카즈사;02;싫어하는 이야기를 하러 왔다고? 그게 무슨 소리야?\n#3;em;[땀]",
      "TextJp": "私が嫌がりそうな話をしに来た？\nどういうこと？",
      "TextCn": "为了跟我说我可能会不喜欢的话来的？\n那是什么意思？",
      "TextTh": "จะมาคุยเรื่องที่ฉันไม่ชอบงั้นเหรอ? หมายความว่ายังไงน่ะ?",
      "TextTw": "為了跟我說我可能會不喜歡的話來的？\n那是什麼意思？",
      "TextEn": "You have bad news? What is it?",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0004.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[confused]私が嫌がりそうな話をしに来た？\nどういうこと？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10014060,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;카즈사;00;그거 혹시…….",
      "TextJp": "もしかして……",
      "TextCn": "难道说……",
      "TextTh": "นั่นมัน หรือว่า...",
      "TextTw": "難道說……",
      "TextEn": "Do you mean...",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0005.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[hesitant]もしかして……"
    },
