      "TextTh": "อันนี้ หนังสือคำท้าอันนี้น่ะ...",
      "TextTw": "在這麼晚的時間……特地叫我出來……",
      "TextEn": "This challenge...",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10014060/lines/0028.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[low volume]こんな遅い時間にさ……わざわざ呼び出してまで……"
